  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve services offered to its members and reposition itself as an Association of choice that is effective and efficient, GEA developed a Strategic plan 2022-2026. It is in the middle of the implementation of the Strategic Plan and the ILO is supporting this process.
The strategy of the intervention includes the development of policy, training tools, conducting surveys and training services. The ILO will also facilitate the establishment of new Employers&#x2019; Association in the Shea Sector to promote decent work in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
